---
layout: layouts/base.njk
titleInContent: true
ogType: article
---
{#- Article page: title, date, category link, draft notice, summary, body and
    the link to the same article in the other language. The machine-translated
    notice is rendered by layouts/base.njk at the top of main for every page
    with machineTranslated: true. `alternate` is computed by src.11tydata.js;
    when it is null the link is simply absent. The header/footer
    inside the article are divs so each page keeps exactly one header and
    footer landmark. Conditional tags sit at column 0 so a false branch leaves
    an empty line rather than trailing whitespace. -#}
{%- set langPrefix = "" if lang == site.languages.default else "/" + lang -%}
<article class="container article">
  <div class="article-header">
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="article-meta">
      <time datetime="{{ page.date | isoDate }}">{{ page.date | localeDate(lang) }}</time>
      · <a href="{{ langPrefix }}/blog/{{ category }}/">{{ strings[lang].categories[category] }}</a>
    </p>
{% if draft %}
    {% include "partials/notice-draft.njk" %}
{% endif %}
    <p class="article-summary">{{ description }}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="article-body">
    {{ content | safe }}
  </div>
{% if alternate %}
  <div class="article-footer">
    <p><a href="{{ alternate.url }}" hreflang="{{ alternate.lang }}" lang="{{ alternate.lang }}">{{ strings[lang].article.readInOtherLanguage }}</a></p>
  </div>
{% endif %}
</article>
